DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows still dominate = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Thu 19 Nov): 10 highs vs 423 lows (WSJ), the most lows and fewest highs in our chart (which starts 6 Oct), as the S&P fell 2% for a sixth straight loss. Lows have beaten highs on every session this month except 4 Nov; more highs than lows again would be the first sign of healing."};

